theorem consumerAccepted : Claim expectedSourceHash actualSourceHash capturedSource proposedIR :=
⟨Eq.refl expectedSourceHash, fun x =>
  Eq.mpr (id (congrArg (fun _a => evalIR _a x = evalSource capturedSource x) witness))
    (construct_eval capturedSource x)⟩
'consumerAccepted' depends on axioms: [propext]
